              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.11.13+DEU.11.14+DEU.11.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 11.13–15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.1+DEU.28.2+DEU.28.3+DEU.28.4+DEU.28.5+DEU.28.6+DEU.28.7+DEU.28.8+DEU.28.9+DEU.28.10+DEU.28.11+DEU.28.12+DEU.28.13+DEU.28.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28.1–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If you live according to my laws and obey my commands, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will send you rain at the right time, so that the land will produce crops and the trees will bear fruit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your crops will be so plentiful that you will still be harvesting corn when it is time to pick grapes, and you will still be picking grapes when it is time to sow corn. You will have all that you want to eat, and you will live in safety in your land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I will give you peace in your land, and you will sleep without being afraid of anyone. I will get rid of the dangerous animals in the land, and there will be no more war there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will be victorious over your enemies; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "five of you will be able to defeat a hundred, and a hundred will be able to defeat 10,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bless you and give you many children; I will keep my part of the covenant that I made with you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your harvests will be so plentiful that they will last for a year, and even then you will have to throw away what is left of the old harvest to make room for the new. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will live among you in my sacred tent, and I will never turn away from you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cor 6.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will be with you; I will be your God, and you will be my people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, brought you out of Egypt so that you would no longer be slaves. I broke the power that held you down and I let you walk with your head held high.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “If you will not obey my commands, you will be punished. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you refuse to obey my laws and commands and break the covenant I have made with you, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will punish you. I will bring disaster on you — incurable diseases and fevers that will make you blind and cause your life to waste away. You will sow your seed, but it will do you no good, because your enemies will conquer you and eat what you have grown. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will turn against you, so that you will be defeated, and those who hate you will rule over you; you will be so terrified that you will run when no one is chasing you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If even after all this you still do not obey me, I will increase your punishment seven times. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will break your stubborn pride; there will be no rain, and your land will be dry and as hard as iron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All your hard work will do you no good, because your land will not produce crops and the trees will not bear fruit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If you still continue to resist me and refuse to obey me, I will again increase your punishment seven times. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will send dangerous animals among you, and they will kill your children, destroy your livestock, and leave so few of you that your roads will be deserted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If after all this punishment you still do not listen to me, but continue to defy me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then I will turn on you and punish you seven times harder than before. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bring war on you to punish you for breaking our covenant, and if you gather in your cities for safety, I will send incurable diseases among you, and you will be forced to surrender to your enemies. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will cut off your food supply, so that ten women will need only one oven to bake all the bread they have. They will ration it out, and when you have eaten it all, you will still be hungry.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If after all this you still continue to defy me and refuse to obey me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then in my anger I will turn on you and again make your punishment seven times worse than before. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your hunger will be so great that you will eat your own children. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will destroy your places of worship on the hills, tear down your incense altars, and throw your dead bodies on your fallen idols. In utter disgust ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will turn your cities into ruins, destroy your places of worship, and refuse to accept your sacrifices. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will destroy your land so completely that the enemies who occupy it will be shocked at the destruction. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bring war on you and scatter you in foreign lands. Your land will be deserted, and your cities left in ruins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the land will enjoy the years of complete rest that you would not give it; it will lie abandoned and get its rest while you are in exile in the land of your enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.34+LEV.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.34",
              "LEV.26.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.34+LEV.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.34",
              "LEV.26.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I will make those of you who are in exile so terrified that the sound of a leaf blowing in the wind will make you run. You will run as if you were being pursued in battle, and you will fall when there is no enemy near you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will stumble over one another when no one is chasing you, and you will be unable to fight against any enemy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will die in exile, swallowed up by the land of your enemies. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The few of you who survive in the land of your enemies will waste away because of your own sin and the sin of your ancestors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But your descendants will confess their sins and the sins of their ancestors, who resisted me and rebelled against me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and made me turn against them and send them into exile in the land of their enemies. At last, when your descendants are humbled and they have paid the penalty for their sin and rebellion, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.7+GEN.17.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 17.7–8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.26.3+GEN.26.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.3–4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.13+GEN.28.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28.13–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will remember my covenant with Jacob and with Isaac and with Abraham, and I will renew my promise to give my people the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "First, however, the land must be rid of its people, so that it can enjoy its complete rest, and they must pay the full penalty for having rejected my laws and my commands. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But even then, when they are still in the land of their enemies, I will not completely abandon or destroy them. That would put an end to my covenant with them, and I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " their God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will renew the covenant that I made with their ancestors when I showed all the nations my power by bringing my people out of Egypt, in order that I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", might be their God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All these are the laws and commands that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gave to Moses on Mount Sinai for the people of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
